P5CikQ3IcHCFUoDA",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ3IcHCFYoDQ",null,null,null,[3],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["最近造訪木之本拉麵的另一間分店-得勝店。空間較光華店小，品項也較少。同樣都只有兩人服務，待客一樣客氣友善。得勝店還會招待小菜跟飲料。小菜雖是招待，但一點也不馬虎豆干跟海帶，滷得很入味。要說缺點，應該是距離馬路太近，用餐的時候蠻吵的。\n這次點的是蒜香雞白湯拉麵跟炸雞。湯頭的溫度被油脂封在裡面，喝的時候要小心燙口。但就是這麼濃郁的雞白湯，才讓人讚不絕口。真材實料，入喉滑順，整個香氣在口中炸裂，而且沒有雞的羶腥味，但蒜味稍嫌不足。搭配Q彈麵條，算是不錯的體驗。不過，溏心蛋的蛋黃過熟，很像是白煮蛋的口感，個人不太喜歡。炸雞包含肉汁，沾著美奶滋，是個不錯的搭配。可以給到超讚的評價，值得回訪！\n再訪：好吃值得一吃再吃，點的是松露雞白湯拉麵以及炸豆腐。豆腐是用雞蛋豆腐下去炸的，搭配柴魚片和日式醬油，口感不錯。溏心蛋，這次就比較像溏心蛋了，蛋黃沒有過熟的問題。雖說是松露雞白湯，但是湯頭卻喝不出有松露獨特的香氣，松露的份量，可能加的不夠吧！只有雞高湯的味道。",null,[0,116]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTVjbGx4V1RkM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTVjbGx4V1RkM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTVjbGx4V1RkM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTVjbGx4V1RkM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTVjbGx4V1RkM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTVjbGx4V1RkM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,3059,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5cllxWTd3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x180f4665f88421e5!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC9rYqY7wE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5cllxWTd3RRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdD