IHM0ogKEICAgIDlstKyFA\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv.tactile\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0x180f4665f88421e5"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["0","1733681785335980517"],null,null,[null,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURsc3NMX0hBEAE"]],"CIHM0ogKEICAgIDlstKyFA",1]],null,null,null,[[["GUIDED_DINING_MODE"],"你是內用、外帶或是使用外送服務？",[[[["E:DINE_IN"],"內用",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ3YcHCHsoAA"]],1],null,null,"訂單類型",null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ3IcHCHooEQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"用餐類型為何？",[[[["E:DINNER"],"晚餐",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ3YcHCH0oAA"]],1],null,null,"餐點類型",null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ3IcHCHwoEg",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ3YcHCH8oAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ3IcHCH4oEw",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["小小空間兩人打理頂多接待12人，點完餐後貌似小老闆隨即送上飲料招待，第一印象已加分到滿。\n\n1️⃣用餐日為10月下旬，現場menu比對網路查到的精簡了許多，以烹調區及內用區規模，個人認同〝這樣就好〞。\n\n2️⃣拉麵端上時提醒會燙口，相機先食約1分半才動口，不是絕對貓舌應會覺得湯溫好入口。\n\n3️⃣麵湯雞味濃，不嗆不顯膩，乍看覺得是濃縮還原湯，喝到後段的確有渣渣，同屬連鎖店，味道比例與順口度強過「麵匡匡」太多。\n\n4️⃣拉麵配料與賣相呈現乾淨引發食欲，娃娃菜的存在感覺又多了健康，松露醬另以小碟盛裝，若是〝忘了放〞的補救也無妨，一開始湯頭不髒反而呼應要表現的視覺舒爽。\n\n5️⃣似乎固定配置蛤蜊，湯頭主KEY除了雞濃還有貝鮮。舒肥雞胸灑了香草籽增香，嫩口之餘沒有血水味攪局。\n\n6️⃣炸雞其貌不揚，咬下才見真章，皮厚也偏硬，肉汁未消失。相比拉麵，炸雞更燙口，聽到鬧鐘聲，確實執行SOP，鹹香有致，外皮略乾剛好用沙拉醬補足。",null,[0,100]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNjM05NWDBoQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNjM05NWDBoQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNjM05NWDBoQ