以接受～\n麵條是我喜歡的細麵\n唯一希望可以多胡麻蔬菜的小菜選項，可以均衡一下😆\n人多的時候出餐比較慢，但店家態度非常好👍🏻\n\n————————————————\n有一陣子沒去了，今天整個差很多⋯⋯\n最不行的是麵超級軟爛，像在吃一坨麵糊\n青菜變成生菜（超級不搭🥲）\n玉米筍很生的味道，懷疑沒熟（還是根本就是生的？）\n可能出餐品質要稍微顧一下\n以前很不錯的，怎麼變成這樣😭",null,[0,60]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlRFl5T0RoQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlRFl5T0RoQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlRFl5T0RoQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlRFl5T0RoQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlRFl5T0RoQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11397818630015334736/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlRFl5T0RoQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,2081,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQteDYyODhBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x180f4665f88421e5!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID-x6288AE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQteDYyODhBRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQteDYyODhBRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQteDYyOENBEhNDZ3dJNk4yeXFnWVE4SlN5aXdFGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRC14NjI4aUFFEhNDZ3dJNk4yeXFnWVE4SlN5aXdFIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR5SGE-GVGDxgqCzBfSTl2Y0dRN2Rr\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQoykI7gEoCA"],null,[null,[[1,3]]]],"0ahUKEwjx6J7zzNKWAxXUeV4EHf-0AlAQ0pMFCKIBKAU"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiCiJjzzNKWAxXQbPUHHUP5CikQ0pMFCN4BKAU"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoNHVYS2dRRRAB",["0x0:0x180f4665